# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Not for publication
#
# Local notes and the per-checkout vocabulary file stay on disk and out of
# history. The vocabulary file holds the business nouns the discipline check
# should reject, and those nouns are themselves the thing being kept out of
# the repository — so the ignored filename is matched by pattern rather than
# written out here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
docs/*prompt.md
tools/check_tokens.local.json
